<tr id="S3.F1.4.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.F1.4.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_right ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">4  </td>
<td id="S3.F1.4.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#CCFFE6;padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;" colspan="3"><span id="S3.F1.4.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_top" style="width:241.5pt;">
<span id="S3.F1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent" style="--ltx-bg-color:#CCFFE6;">
<span id="S3.F1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.F1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span><span id="S3.F1.p4.1.2" class="ltx_text">
<span id="S3.F1.p4.1.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span id="S3.F1.p4.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S3.F1.p4.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="S3.F1.p4.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="S3.F1.p4.1.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.F1.p4.1.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[A<math id="S3.F1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#CCFFE6;" mathbackground="#CCFFE6" stretchy="false">⟩</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rangle</annotation></semantics></math>B]
Hi! Here are my preferences: I value balls the most, then hats, and I don’t value the book at all. How about you? What do you value most?</span></span>
</span></span></span>
</span></span><span id="S3.F1.p4.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
</span></span></td>
<td id="S3.F1.4.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;"></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.F1.4.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.F1.4.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_right ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">5  </td>
<td id="S3.F1.4.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;"></td>
<td id="S3.F1.4.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;"></td>
<td id="S3.F1.4.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9B8;padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;" colspan="2"><span id="S3.F1.4.6.4.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_top" style="width:241.5pt;">
<span id="S3.F1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9B8;">
<span id="S3.F1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.F1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span><span id="S3.F1.p5.1.2" class="ltx_text">
<span id="S3.F1.p5.1.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span id="S3.F1.p5.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S3.F1.p5.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="S3.F1.p5.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="S3.F1.p5.1.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.F1.p5.1.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[A<math id="S3.F1.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\langle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9B8;" mathbackground="#FFD9B8" stretchy="false">⟨</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\langle</annotation></semantics></math>B]
Thanks for sharing! I value the book most, while hats and balls are equally less important to me. Would you take both balls and one hat, and I’ll take the book and the other hat? That way, we both get what we value most.</span></span>
</span></span></span>
</span></span><span id="S3.F1.p5.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
</span></span></td></tr>
