That sounds fair! With this split, I’d get both balls and one hat, while you’d get the book and one hat, so we each get what we value most. Ready to submit this as my proposal unless you’d like to tweak anything.</span></span>
</span></span></span>
</span></span><span id="S3.F1.p6.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
