</span></span><span id="S3.F3.p3.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
</span></span></td>
<td id="S3.F3.4.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;"></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.F3.4.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.F3.4.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_right ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">4  </td>
<td id="S3.F3.4.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;"></td>
<td id="S3.F3.4.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;"></td>
<td id="S3.F3.4.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9B8;padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;" colspan="2"><span id="S3.F3.4.5.4.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="S3.F3.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9B8;">
<span id="S3.F3.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.F3.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span><span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2" class="ltx_text">
<span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[GM<math id="S3.F3.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\langle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9B8;" mathbackground="#FFD9B8" stretchy="false">⟨</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\langle</annotation></semantics></math>B]</span>
<span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">STRATEGIC REASONING: I can increase the value of the other player’s proposal for me by swapping Rope with Book. Let me propose this.</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">PROPOSAL: Rope, Ball, Magazine</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.F3.p4.1.2.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">ARGUMENT: I value Rope highly, but not Book. How about we swap them?</span></span>
</span></span></span>
</span></span><span id="S3.F3.p4.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
</span></span></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.F3.4.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.F3.4.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_right ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">5  </td>
<td id="S3.F3.4.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;"></td>
<td id="S3.F3.4.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;" colspan="2"><span id="S3.F3.4.6.3.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
