<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Additional Results</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>%Played and Quality Scores</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A1.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ A.1 %Played and Quality Scores ‣ Appendix A Additional Results ‣ The Price of Thought: A Multilingual Analysis of Reasoning, Performance, and Cost of Negotiation in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> shows the Played and Quality Scores for each language separately, averaged for all games.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F10" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<figure id="A1.F10.sf1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.08098v1/overall_scatter_across_games_en.svg" id="A1.F10.sf1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/401;" width="476" height="401"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(a) </span>Played-Quality Scores for English averaged for all games.</figcaption>
