<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The average token usage and cost for English, German and Italian experiments are given in Figure <a href="#A1.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ A.2 Token Usage &amp; Cost ‣ Appendix A Additional Results ‣ The Price of Thought: A Multilingual Analysis of Reasoning, Performance, and Cost of Negotiation in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>.</p>
</div>
