<span id="A2.F23.p4.1.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A2.F23.p4.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F23.p4.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F23.p4.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F23.p4.1.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F23.p4.1.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[A<math id="A2.F23.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#CCFFE6;" mathbackground="#CCFFE6" stretchy="false">⟩</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rangle</annotation></semantics></math>B]
Hallo! Lass uns eine Einigung finden. Mir sind Magnete nichts wert, die Schaufel ist etwas wert, und die Blume ist mir am wichtigsten.</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.F23.p4.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F23.p4.1.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F23.p4.1.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F23.p4.1.2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F23.p4.1.2.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Vorschlag: Du bekommst alle 4 Magnete. Ich bekomme die Blume und die Schaufel. Wie klingt das für dich?</span></span>
</span></span></span>
</span></span><span id="A2.F23.p4.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
</span></span></td>
<td id="A2.F23.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;"></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.F23.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.F23.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_right ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">5  </td>
<td id="A2.F23.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;"></td>
<td id="A2.F23.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;"></td>
<td id="A2.F23.2.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9B8;padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;" colspan="2"><span id="A2.F23.2.6.4.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F23.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9B8;">
<span id="A2.F23.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F23.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span><span id="A2.F23.p5.1.2" class="ltx_text">
<span id="A2.F23.p5.1.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A2.F23.p5.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F23.p5.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F23.p5.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F23.p5.1.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F23.p5.1.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[A<math id="A2.F23.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\langle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9B8;" mathbackground="#FFD9B8" stretchy="false">⟨</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\langle</annotation></semantics></math>B]
Klingt fair für mich. Mir sind die Magnete am wichtigsten, die Schaufel ist mir auch etwas wert und die Blume moderat. Dein Vorschlag passt gut zu unseren Präferenzen -- ich bin einverstanden.</span></span>
</span></span></span>
</span></span><span id="A2.F23.p5.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
</span></span></td></tr>
