<span id="A2.F23.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;">
<span id="A2.F23.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F23.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span><span id="A2.F23.p7.1.2" class="ltx_text">
<span id="A2.F23.p7.1.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A2.F23.p7.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F23.p7.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F23.p7.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F23.p7.1.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F23.p7.1.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[GM<math id="A2.F23.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#E6E6E6;" mathbackground="#E6E6E6" stretchy="false">⟩</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rangle</annotation></semantics></math>B]
Der andere Spieler hat einen geheimen Vorschlag gemacht. Jetzt bist du an der Reihe, einen eigenen Vorschlag zu machen.</span></span>
</span></span></span>
</span></span><span id="A2.F23.p7.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
</span></span></td>
