<td id="A2.F26.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_right ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">4  </td>
<td id="A2.F26.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#CCFFE6;padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;" colspan="3"><span id="A2.F26.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent" style="--ltx-bg-color:#CCFFE6;">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span><span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2" class="ltx_text">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[A<math id="A2.F26.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#CCFFE6;" mathbackground="#CCFFE6" stretchy="false">⟩</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rangle</annotation></semantics></math>B]
Hi! I want to maximize our combined points. Easiest is if we both share our per-item values and give each item to whoever values it more.</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">My values are: phone = 4, mirror = 2 (each), fruit = 1 (each).</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">What are your values for phone, mirror, and fruit? Then we can assign:</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Phone to whoever has the higher value.</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Mirrors: both to the higher per-mirror value, or one each if equal.</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Fruits: same logic.</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p4.1.2.1.7.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Once you share your numbers, I’ll suggest the exact split and we can both submit complementary proposals that use all items.</span></span>
</span></span></span>
</span></span><span id="A2.F26.p4.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
</span></span></td>
<td id="A2.F26.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;"></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.F26.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.F26.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_right ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">5  </td>
<td id="A2.F26.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;"></td>
<td id="A2.F26.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;"></td>
<td id="A2.F26.2.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9B8;padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;" colspan="2"><span id="A2.F26.2.6.4.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9B8;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span><span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2" class="ltx_text">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">[A<math id="A2.F26.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\langle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFD9B8;" mathbackground="#FFD9B8" stretchy="false">⟨</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\langle</annotation></semantics></math>B]
Thanks! Here are my values:</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Phone = 6</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Mirror = 0 (each)</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- Fruit = 2 (each)</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">To maximize our combined points, the efficient split is:</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- I take: phone + both fruits</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.7.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">- You take: both mirrors</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.8.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">That yields totals: me = 10, you = 4, combined = 14 (which is maximal).</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.F26.p5.1.2.1.9.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">If you agree, confirm and we can both submit matching proposals. I’ll request: 1 phone, 2 fruits, 0 mirrors. You’d request: 2 mirrors, 0 phone, 0 fruits.</span></span>
</span></span></span>
</span></span><span id="A2.F26.p5.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
</span></span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.F26.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.F26.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_right ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;">6  </td>
<td id="A2.F26.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="--ltx-bg-color:#CCFFE6;padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;" colspan="3"><span id="A2.F26.2.7.2.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
