<div id="A4.SS5.SSS0.Px2.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS5.SSS0.Px2.p5.1" class="ltx_p">As another strategy, we encounter implicit role assignment, where one player is more active in making proposals while the other is more reactive, simply refusing or demanding changes to the proposal of the other player. This strategy turns out to correlate with worse overall performance and is diminished in reasoning models, which generally prefer to take consecutive turns in making proposals.</p>
</div>
